{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本AV女優轉為DJ的濱崎真緒（藝名：DJ Mao），今日（1日）凌晨在尖沙嘴一個私人派對，懷疑遭人「落藥」致神志不清及抽搐，其經理人報警求助，送院治理後留醫深切治療病房，警方將案件列作「意圖損害等而施用毒藥」，交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第6隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.232195+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T06:42:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:23.462305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.768580+00:00","content_hash":"a4ef226d8cdc4e86afa8c353b80d22ed4bd65e7839b628bd41987537c7ae93e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}